  "description": "Our Trampoline is a round bouncing mat set flush into the ground, with a wide dark teal surround. Because it sits at ground level there is no frame to climb onto, and children step straight on and off. Bouncing builds leg strength, rhythm and balance, and it is one of the few pieces that children of different ages enjoy together. The mat area is 5' x 5' and we recommend a safe play area of 11' x 11'. A compact trampoline like this adds variety to a society garden or school play area beside slides and climbers. It comes in the Mineral colour shade. Tell us about your ground and we will advise on placement in your layout drawing.",
